  "document": "May Lamok sa Loob ng Kulambo\nMay Lamok sa Loob ng Kulambo is a 1984 Philippine comedy film directed by, and produced by Hirene Lopez and Danny L. Zialcita as the film's executive producer. The film stars Gloria Diaz, Eddie Garcia, Amy Austria, and Tommy Abuel. The film was released in 1984 by Essex Films. Another related film called,\" May Daga sa Labas ng Lungga\", was released earlier in the same year."
